      "y": 8736,
      "name": "c/asio",
      "fill": "#9ea3b0",
      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
      "width": 1800,
      "content": "Windows only: the enumerated drivers with their probed channel counts. Drawn as PICK rows — a leading check on the selected driver and no chevron — because this asks the same question settings-device does, and a chevron promises an opening there is none of.",
      "fontFamily": "Inter",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontWeight": "normal"
    },
