      "fill": "#9ea3b0",
      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
      "width": 1800,
      "content": "Console, hardware and legal. Segno, not Loopy — the pre-rebrand name. No audio-engine row: nothing in the build reports an engine version, and a row invented for it would state a fact about the running binary that nobody measured.",
