      "fill": "#9ea3b0",
      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
      "width": 1800,
      "content": "Seventeen options are two families, not one list — six over a quarter note, eleven over an eighth — so the drawer carries a caption per group, the way AUDIO / settings-rate holds SAMPLE RATE and BUFFER. Bare tokens go in a grid: as one 70px row each this is 1,190px of scroll inside an 830px sheet, every row spending its full width on four characters.",
