      "fill": "#9ea3b0",
      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
      "width": 1800,
      "content": "The one chooser on these faces that is NOT pick-one: the click sounds on a bitmask of hardware outputs, so several cells are lit at once, a tap toggles one bit rather than replacing the answer, and nothing here closes the grid — no single tap ends the question. The row summarises: nowhere / all outputs / Out 1 · Out 2 / N outputs once naming them all would not fit.",
