      "y": 7236,
      "name": "c/tracks-length-pick",
      "fill": "#9ea3b0",
      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
      "width": 1800,
      "content": "The row opens in place onto its presets, the console's pick-one for bare tokens — the same drawer LOOP / loop-output opens. A tap answers the question, so it also closes it. The choice set is the one the Settings page already offers; two surfaces disagreeing about which lengths exist is a bug nobody finds until a rig is set up on one and played from the other.",
