    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "IvOH8",
      "x": 26484,
      "y": 8736,
      "name": "c/audio-refused",
      "fill": "#9ea3b0",
      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
      "width": 1800,
      "content": "The device is not running what was asked for — it either refused the config outright or opened and negotiated something else. The banner says so and the selection SNAPS to what it IS running; the rig never reports a setting it is not using. There is NO in-flight companion to this screen: reopening the device is a synchronous call, so it has either succeeded or failed by the time anything could be drawn, and a slow driver blocks the app rather than yielding a frame to draw in. An `audio-negotiating` screen was drawn and then deleted for exactly that reason (#528).",
      "fontFamily": "Inter",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontWeight": "normal"
    },
