      "y": 2736,
      "name": "c/signal-track",
      "fill": "#9ea3b0",
      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
      "width": 1800,
      "content": "The fourth tab the strip has always promised and no frame ever drew. Derived from the loop face, changing only what the stage changes: the coordinate loses its lane, because a track bus sits downstream of all of them, and the chain feeds the master sum rather than the track mix. A card still carries its monitor line only when a rack is loaded — the vacant one omits it here for the same reason it does on the loop face.",
